        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the case concerns the constitutionality of COPA\u2019s reliance on community standards to identify material harmful to minors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "97c6498b642d9972ab0b099d0d504cd1760391bc30c03fbee2d51ef7006909fb",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-97c6498b642d-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 31,
              "start": 31
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the specific question presented is whether the Third Circuit correctly barred enforcement of COPA on First Amendment grounds because the statute depends on community standards."
      }
